    "interpretation": "The three original request/ack test names pass on all five platforms. The two original state-manager test names are absent after the develop merge. Current deferred/reentrant state-manager tests were skipped by TIA. The repository-level delayed-publication regression passes on all five platforms and checks that a completion cannot publish an obsolete ready notification after a newer context or reset.",
